    "title": "Final call for your favorite recipes! - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Teresa Inserra For the Leader ,\n12 hours ago\nFriday marks the last day to submit recipes for Leader Publications’ annual Holiday Recipe Contest. The contest kicked off Oct. 1. Cooks of any age who live in Jefferson County, Eureka and Wildwood are invited to send in their favorite recipes for the five categories: appetizer, soup, salad, side dish and dessert. Readers are welcome to submit a recipe in any or all categories, up to a maximum of five entries per reader.\nRead full article",
